@leaseId7 = cmt175gz2001nuo1tv3svn3b7

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 0：健康检查
### =====================================================================

### 0.1 查看 OpenAPI 文档（确认服务在线 + M3 路由已注册）
GET {{host}}/api-docs.json

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 1：平台管理员登录
### =====================================================================

### 1.1 平台管理员登录 → 回填 @platformToken
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{platformEmail}}",
  "password": "{{platformPassword}}"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 2：创建测试团队（M3 前置依赖）
### =====================================================================

### 2.1 创建团队（portQuota=3）→ 回填 @teamId / @supervisorId / @supervisorPassword
###     initialPassword 仅此一次返回，切勿丢失
POST {{host}}/api/platform/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "M3测试团队_端口租约",
  "supervisorEmail": "{{supervisorEmail}}",
  "expiresAt": "2028-06-30T23:59:59+08:00",
  "portQuota": 3,
  "translationQuota": 1000000
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 3：主管登录 + 生成密钥 + 客户端激活
### =====================================================================

### 3.1 主管登录 → 回填 @supervisorToken
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{supervisorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{supervisorPassword}}"
}

### 4.1 生成密钥 → 回填 @licenseKeyId / @licenseCode
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "客服M3-01",
  "multiDeviceEnabled": false
}

### 5.1 客户端激活 → 回填 @clientAccessToken / @clientId
POST {{host}}/api/client/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{licenseCode}}",
  "fingerprint": "{{fingerprint}}",
  "deviceLabel": "M3测试机-Mac"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 4：T3-01 端口申请（AC1/AC10）
### =====================================================================

### 6.1 端口申请（第1个）→ 回填 @leaseId1
###     预期 200 + data.alreadyHeld=false
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc001"
}

### 6.2 端口申请（第2个）→ 回填 @leaseId2
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "whatsapp:acc002"
}

### 6.3 端口申请（第3个，配额=3）→ 回填 @leaseId3
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc003"
}

### 6.4 超卖测试（第4个应拒绝）→ 预期 409 PORT_EXHAUSTED
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc004"
}

### 6.5 幂等测试：同一 channelAccountKey 再次申请 → 预期 200 + 同一 leaseId + alreadyHeld=true
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc001"
}

### 6.6 鉴权拦截：无 Token → 预期 401
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:noauth"
}

### 6.7 参数校验：缺少 channelAccountKey → 预期 400
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": ""
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 5：T3-02 心跳协议（AC2/AC8/AC12）
### =====================================================================

### 7.1 心跳（上报3个 lease）→ 预期 refreshed=3, revoked=0, held=3, quota=3
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseIds": ["{{leaseId1}}", "{{leaseId2}}", "{{leaseId3}}"]
}

### 7.2 心跳（上报不存在的 leaseId）→ 预期 该 leaseId 出现在 revokedLeaseIds 中
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseIds": ["nonexistent-lease-id"]
}

### 7.3 心跳（空数组）→ 预期 200 + refreshed=0, revoked=0, held=3
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseIds": []
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 6：T3-03 端口释放（AC3）
### =====================================================================

### 8.1 释放端口（lease3）→ 预期 200 + alreadyReleased=false
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/release
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseId": "{{leaseId3}}"
}

### 8.2 释放后心跳（上报含已释放的 lease3）→ 预期 revoked=1, held=2
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseIds": ["{{leaseId1}}", "{{leaseId2}}", "{{leaseId3}}"]
}

### 8.3 幂等：重复释放同一 lease → 预期 200 + alreadyReleased=true
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/release
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseId": "{{leaseId3}}"
}

### 8.4 释放不存在的 lease → 预期 404
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/release
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseId": "nonexistent-lease-id"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 7：T3-04 端口归零（AC4/AC7）
### =====================================================================

### 9.1 端口归零（释放本机全部 HELD）→ 预期 200 + releasedCount=2
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}

### 9.2 归零后心跳（上报旧 lease）→ 预期 全部出现在 revoked 中
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseIds": ["{{leaseId1}}", "{{leaseId2}}"]
}

### 9.3 归零后重新申请（端口应可用）→ 回填 @leaseId5
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc005"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 8：T3-05 手动释放与列表（AC11/AC2）
### =====================================================================

### 10.1 主管端口列表 → 预期返回本团队 HELD 租约列表
GET {{host}}/api/supervisor/ports
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 10.2 主管手动释放（未 confirm）→ 预期 409
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/ports/{{leaseId5}}/release
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": false
}

### 10.3 主管手动释放（confirm=true）→ 预期 200 + alreadyReleased=false
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/ports/{{leaseId5}}/release
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": true
}

### 10.4 释放后再心跳 → 预期 lease5 出现在 revoked 中（撤销感知 ≤2min）
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseIds": ["{{leaseId5}}"]
}

### 10.5 主管手动释放不存在的 lease → 预期 404
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/ports/nonexistent-lease-id/release
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": true
}

### 10.6 鉴权拦截：无 Token → 预期 401
GET {{host}}/api/supervisor/ports

### 10.7 鉴权拦截：客户端 Token 调用主管接口 → 预期 403
GET {{host}}/api/supervisor/ports
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 9：管理员侧端口管理
### =====================================================================

### 11.1 管理员端口列表（全平台）→ 预期返回所有团队 HELD 租约
GET {{host}}/api/platform/ports
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### 11.2 管理员手动释放（confirm=true）→ 可释放任意团队端口
###     需先申请一个新端口（因为之前的都已释放）
POST {{host}}/api/platform/ports/{{leaseId5}}/release
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": true
}

### 11.3 鉴权拦截：主管 Token 调用平台接口 → 预期 403
GET {{host}}/api/platform/ports
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 10：配额下调 + overQuota 联动（AC12）
### =====================================================================

### 12.1 申请2个端口 → 回填 @leaseId6 / @leaseId7
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc006"
}

### 12.2 申请第2个端口 → 回填 @leaseId7
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc007"
}

### 12.3 下调配额到 1（当前 held=2 > quota=1）
PUT {{host}}/api/platform/teams/{{teamId}}/quotas
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "portQuota": 1
}

### 12.4 心跳（应返回 overQuota=true + pendingCloseLeaseIds 含2个）→ 预期 AC12
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseIds": ["{{leaseId6}}", "{{leaseId7}}"]
}

### 12.5 新申请应被拒绝（held > quota）→ 预期 409 PORT_EXHAUSTED
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc008"
}

### 12.6 恢复配额到 3（验证可继续申请）
PUT {{host}}/api/platform/teams/{{teamId}}/quotas
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "portQuota": 5
}

### 12.7 恢复后申请 → 预期 200
POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelAccountKey": "telegram:acc009"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 11：TTL 过期扫描验证（后台 cron，手动触发可选）
### =====================================================================

### 11.1 手动触发过期扫描（需在服务端代码中暴露调试端点，正常通过 cron 自动执行）
###     cron 间隔: leaseScanMinutes（.env 配置，默认 1min）
###     TTL: leaseTtlMs（.env 配置，默认 24h）
###     扫描时写 SYSTEM 审计日志 LEASE_RELEASED_TIMEOUT

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 12：登出
### =====================================================================

### 12.1 主管登出
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 12.2 平台管理员登出
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 附录：边界与异常场景速查
### =====================================================================
### 以下请求可独立执行，用于快速验证边界行为
### =====================================================================

### A.1 端口配额=0 的团队申请 → 预期 409 PORT_EXHAUSTED
# POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
# Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
# X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "channelAccountKey": "telegram:zero-quota"
# }

### A.2 channelAccountKey 超长字符串 → 预期 400（如 schema 有 maxLength）
# POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
# Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
# X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "channelAccountKey": "telegram:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
# }

### A.3 缺少 X-Device-Fingerprint header → 预期 401
# POST {{host}}/api/client/ports/acquire
# Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "channelAccountKey": "telegram:no-fp"
# }

### A.4 主管手动释放其他团队的端口 → 预期 403
# POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/ports/{{otherTeamLeaseId}}/release
# Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "confirm": true
# }
